 (only check if special bin is active) 
 
 ]]></Comment><Text><![CDATA[[XIC(BinControl_Plc.i_SpecialBin) ,XIC(BinControl_Plc.o_SpecialBinActive) ][NE(JobRecipe.Special.BinNo,BinControlRecipe.Special.BinNo) OTL(BinControl_Plc.o_RecipeChanged) ,NE(JobRecipe.Special.TargetValue,BinControlRecipe.Special.TargetValue) OTL(BinControl_Plc.o_TargetValueChanged) ];]]></Text></Rung><Rung Number="4" Type="N"><Comment><![CDATA[Check if bin control recipe for job has changed
 
